            "review_title": "Review at Som Tum Thai - Crescent Mall",
            "review_text": "Glen W\nDa Lat, Vietnam804 contributions\n0\nNot much to get excited about here..\nJan 2024 • Couples\nSub standard service, small portions, lacks any substance. The waitress took our order, dropped the plates off and we chased her down to get the bill. No would you like anything else , can I get you another beer, is everything okay with your meal. So, after little input, and zero follow up, she was wondering why I gave her such a low score on their after dinner survey. \nThis is a prime example of the management not getting it. Over managed employees with no training. We won't be back.\nRead more\nWritten January 3, 2024",
