            "review_title": "Review at Som Tum Thai - Crescent Mall",
            "review_text": "Mae C\n13 contributions\n1\nGo To Place for Authentic Thai Flavors\nApr 2023 • Friends\nWhether it's lunch or dinner with friends, family, or colleagues, Som Tum Thai is definitely a perfect place to share sumptuous Thai flavors. The ambience is quite cozy with their low-light intimate concept. I particularly love their Thai red milk tea that you can garnish with chewy bubbles. The seafood are very fresh and the preparation is of good quality. Price point is quite reasonable for the quality and taste. Overall a great restaurant to try!\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten April 25, 2023",
